This small door allows a sysop/user to check out much is online in the
currently joined conference.  They just type SIZE, and in a second or
two, the information for each directory and the totals are displayed.

The only config file this door requires is BBS:CONF_PATH/NDIRS which is
to specify the # of dirs in the conference.  People running /X v2, and
S!X should already have this file present in all the conferences, as well
as the people who run Turbo NewScan (who doesn't!)...

I use this door to track how much I have online so I know when it's time
to press a CD.  All my co-sysops use this door cause they find it neat!

Here is a sample:

SizeCheck v1.1 by Eric The RED/bAD kARMA

